    "Your own event: add data-flxan-event=\"name\" (and optional data-flxan-param) to a link, or call flxan.track(\"name\", \"detail\") in JavaScript. PHP: flxan_track_event( \"name\", \"detail\", amount ).": "您自己的事件:将 data-flxan-event=\"name\" (和可选的 data-flxan-param)添加到链接,或在 JavaScript 中调用 flxan.track(\"name\", \"detail\")。 PHP:flxan_track_event(“名称”,“详细信息”,金额)。",
    "Funnels": "漏斗",
    "Shows how far visitors get. Each step can be a page (all pages starting with that path), an event (e.g. the \"Pay\" click) or the site entry. Up to 5 funnels with 10 steps each. Changes apply to new visits; funnel steps can also be picked as goals on the Journeys screen.": "显示访客走了多远。每个步骤可以是一个页面(以该路径开头的所有页面)、一个事件(例如“支付”点击)或站点条目。最多 5 个漏斗,每个漏斗有 10 个步骤。更改适用于新的访问;也可以在“旅程”屏幕上选择漏斗步骤作为目标。",
