    "Flux AI chat and MCP clients (Claude and others) read stats with: flxan_summary, flxan_timeseries, flxan_pages, flxan_referrers, flxan_breakdown, flxan_events, flxan_realtime, flxan_page, flxan_compare, flxan_funnel, flxan_journeys, flxan_refs, flxan_ref_save. Access needs the \"View statistics\" capability (flxan_view), which Flux Roles can grant.": "Flux AI 聊天和 MCP 客户端(Claude 等)通过以下方式读取统计信息:flxan_summary、flxan_timeseries、flxan_pages、flxan_referrers、flxan_breakdown、flxan_events、flxan_realtime、flxan_page、flxan_compare、flxan_funnel、flxan_journeys、flxan_refs、flxan_ref_save。 Access 需要“查看统计信息”功能 (flxan_view),Flux 角色可以授予该功能。",
